{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23360","headline":"寄庾侍郎 · 白居易","name":"寄庾侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一双华亭鹤，数片太湖石。\n巉巉苍玉峰，矫矫青云翮。\n是时岁云暮，淡薄烟景夕。\n庭霜封石棱，池雪印鹤迹。\n幽致竟谁别，闲静聊自适。\n怀哉庾顺之，好是今宵客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}